{% comment %}
  SECTION: Ingredient Transparency
  Add to Shopify: Online Store → Themes → Edit code → Sections → New section → paste this
  Then add to your homepage template via the theme editor.

  DOSES: confirmed from brand documentation + research-backed formulation consult.
  Verify against your physical product label before publishing.
  Flagged items: [ confirm X ] means Leo should cross-check this value.
{% endcomment %}

<section class="pc-ingredients" id="ingredients">
  <div class="pc-ingredients__inner">

    <div class="pc-ingredients__header">
      <span class="pc-ingredients__eyebrow">What's inside</span>
      <h2 class="pc-ingredients__title">Every ingredient. Every dose.<br>Nothing hidden.</h2>
      <p class="pc-ingredients__subtitle">
        Most functional coffee brands don't show you the numbers.
        We do. Every ingredient in Power Coffee is in there for a reason,
        dosed to actually work.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="pc-ingredients__grid">

      <!-- 1. Instant Coffee + Matcha (combined caffeine) -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">☕</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Instant Coffee</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">175mg total caffeine per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          The base. 175mg of caffeine per serving (from instant coffee and matcha combined),
          enough to anchor the formula without spiking cortisol. Add to your regular coffee
          for a stronger morning, or use alone in hot water. Either way, the rest of the
          formula does the work.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Matcha -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">🍵</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Matcha Green Tea</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">600mg per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          Matcha releases caffeine slowly — no spike, no crash. Unlike coffee caffeine,
          matcha's caffeine is bound to L-theanine in the leaf, which smooths the
          stimulant arc and extends the hold by 2–3 hours.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. L-Theanine -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">🧠</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">L-Theanine</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">200mg per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          The "no jitter" ingredient. L-theanine creates alert calm — sharpness
          without restlessness. Research shows the combination of L-theanine and
          caffeine improves attention accuracy more than caffeine alone.
          We add it separately on top of what matcha contributes naturally
          so the dose is consistent, not batch-dependent.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. Taurine -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">⚡</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Taurine</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">2,000mg per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          2,000mg — twice what Red Bull puts in a can. Taurine is a neuromodulator,
          not a stimulant. It doesn't add energy; it changes the quality of it.
          It supports mitochondrial function and reduces overstimulation,
          which is why the energy holds without the edge.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Pea Protein -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">💪</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Pea Protein</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">5,000mg (5g) per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          5 grams per scoop. Not for muscle — for blood sugar. Protein slows the
          post-caffeine glucose drop that causes the 10am crash. Most functional coffees
          don't do this. We consider it the most underrated ingredient in the formula.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 6. Cinnamon -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">🌶️</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Cinnamon</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">500mg per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          Not for flavor. Research indicates cinnamon supports insulin sensitivity,
          which stabilizes blood sugar after stimulant consumption. A steadier blood
          sugar floor means a steadier focus floor. The 10am crash is a blood sugar
          problem — cinnamon is part of the fix.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 7. Ginkgo Biloba -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">🌿</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Ginkgo Biloba</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">120mg per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          Supports blood circulation to the brain. The tree that survived the Hiroshima
          blast. Clinical research at 120mg associates ginkgo with improved short-term
          memory and cognitive endurance during extended work sessions — not just
          a morning effect.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 8. Ginger -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">🫚</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">Ginger Root</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">250mg per serving</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          Mildly thermogenic and anti-inflammatory. Supports digestion and reduces
          the stomach sensitivity some people have from stimulants on an empty stomach.
          Makes the formula work for people who can't do coffee without food.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 9. L-Carnitine -->
      <div class="pc-ingredient">
        <div class="pc-ingredient__top">
          <span class="pc-ingredient__icon">🔋</span>
          <div>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__name">L-Carnitine</span>
            <span class="pc-ingredient__dose">See label for exact dose</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pc-ingredient__mechanism">
          Transports fatty acids into mitochondria for energy. Unlike stimulants,
          L-carnitine works at the cellular level, supporting fat metabolism and
          reducing mental fatigue during extended focus sessions. Used by endurance
          athletes to maintain output when glycogen runs low.
        </p>
      </div>

      {% comment %}
        INGREDIENTS 10 + 11: Add your remaining 2 ingredients below once confirmed
        from the physical product label. Candidates: black pepper/piperine, MCT powder, B12.
        Use the block structure above.
      {% endcomment %}

    </div><!-- /.pc-ingredients__grid -->

    <div class="pc-ingredients__footer">
      <div class="pc-ingredients__total">
        <span class="pc-ingredients__total-label">Total per serving:</span>
        <span class="pc-ingredients__total-value">10g · 11 active ingredients · 0 fillers</span>
      </div>
      <p class="pc-ingredients__disclaimer">
        These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration.
        This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div><!-- /.pc-ingredients__inner -->
</section>

<style>
.pc-ingredients {
  background: #171412;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  padding: 80px 24px;
  font-family: -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
}

.pc-ingredients__inner {
  max-width: 1080px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.pc-ingredients__header {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 64px;
}

.pc-ingredients__eyebrow {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 12px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #D9A633;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.pc-ingredients__title {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 46px);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.15;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  margin: 0 0 20px;
}

.pc-ingredients__subtitle {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.65);
  max-width: 580px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.pc-ingredients__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, 1fr));
  gap: 2px;
  background: rgba(247,240,224,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(247,240,224,0.08);
  border-radius: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.pc-ingredient {
  padding: 28px 24px;
  background: #1E1A17;
  transition: background 0.2s;
}

.pc-ingredient:hover {
  background: #252019;
}

.pc-ingredient__top {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 14px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.pc-ingredient__icon {
  font-size: 26px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 2px;
}

.pc-ingredient__name {
  display: block;
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: #F7F0E0;
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.pc-ingredient__dose {
  display: block;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #D9A633;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.pc-ingredient__mechanism {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.7);
  margin: 0;
}

.pc-ingredients__footer {
  margin-top: 48px;
  text-align: center;
}

.pc-ingredients__total {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  background: rgba(217,166,51,0.1);
  border: 1px solid rgba(217,166,51,0.25);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 12px 24px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.pc-ingredients__total-label {
  font-size: 13px;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.5);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
}

.pc-ingredients__total-value {
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #D9A633;
}

.pc-ingredients__disclaimer {
  font-size: 12px;
  color: rgba(247,240,224,0.3);
  line-height: 1.6;
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .pc-ingredients {
    padding: 60px 16px;
  }
  .pc-ingredients__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Ingredients Transparency",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
